WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Hey Cobba, hold please.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
This isn't good enough, right? We've got a problem.

00:06.000 --> 00:07.800
Righto, I'll have a look.

00:07.800 --> 00:11.000
Bazza, you wouldn't believe the t-shirt talked into.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
What a numpty you're talking to.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000
Just ducking out for a durry love.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
Hold the line and I'll be back after me, Smoko.

00:23.000 --> 00:24.000
Sorry to keep ya.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.000
Righto, Poppina on hold a tick.

00:26.000 --> 00:28.000
Some drongos have on a birthday.

00:28.000 --> 00:30.000
And there's cake and I'm not missing out.

00:30.000 --> 00:31.000
You're talking?

00:31.000 --> 00:33.000
A bit of a heads up for your mate.

00:33.000 --> 00:36.000
I need this handled right now.

00:37.000 --> 00:39.000
Now reckon you'll want to see this one.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.000
She's going to touch it.

00:45.000 --> 00:47.000
Might want to have a squeeze at this.

